  "notes": "{咎|とが}める is a literary/formal ichidan verb. The expression {良心|りょうしん}が{咎|とが}める (one's conscience bothers one) is a very common idiom.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {良心|りょうしん}が{咎|とが}める: to feel guilty, conscience bothers one\n- 〜を{咎|とが}める: to blame/reproach someone for ~\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {咎|とが} (とが): fault, blame, sin\n- {咎|とが}め (とがめ): blame, censure",
